1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,518
Picture the free energy of the mixture as the reaction proceeds.

2
00:00:04,518 --> 00:00:11,757
From either end, G runs downhill, and the reaction moves until G reaches its lowest point.

3
00:00:11,757 --> 00:00:16,145
At that minimum, there is no further tendency to change.

4
00:00:16,145 --> 00:00:17,812
That is equilibrium.

5
00:00:17,812 --> 00:00:22,278
There, delta G is zero, and Q has become K.

